e ?\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762441115371\", \"cookieKey\": \"b728bf1d-5393-4b9e-a520-723a99daa8d9\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.14.175\", \"messageID\": \"ffa64730-1724-40dc-a549-45218ad69cd2\", \"sessionId\": \"1762441115371\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24951, \"supervisorList\": [\"7848_200\", \"7848_201\", \"7848_202\", \"7848_203\", \"7848_204\", \"7848_206\", \"7848_207\", \"7848_208\", \"7848_209\", \"7848_210\", \"7848_211\", \"7848_212\", \"7848_213\", \"7848_214\", \"7848_215\", \"7848_216\", \"7848_217\", \"7848_218\"], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 53989}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762441150601, \"message\": \"<p>Hello! I\'m Lola – Advanced conversational AI chatbot at Worktual. How can I assist you today?</p> <p>Our innovations blend AI‑powered contact centres, intelligent chatbots, a unified Customer Data Platform and bespoke AI solutions to automate routine interactions, deliver real‑time insights and personalise every customer touchpoint—driving revenue growth, improving retention and cutting operational costs.</p> <p>Could you let me know which industry your business operates in so I can highlight the most relevant solutions for you?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762441115371\", \"cookieKey\": \"b728bf1d-5393-4b9e-a520-723a99daa8d9\", \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.14.175\", \"messageID\": \"a7042224-b975-4bdb-982d-b2f5c962e52b\", \"sessionId\": \"1762441115371\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24951, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 53989}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762441115371\", \"from\": \"1762441115371\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762441368565, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"I am operating sports retail \\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762441115371\", \"cookieKey\": \"b728bf1d-5393-4b9e-a520-723a99daa8d9\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.14.175\", \"messageID\": \"c5e44aee-218d-4043-b2cc-59c946a1872d\", \"sessionId\": \"1762441115371\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24951, \"supervisorList\": [\"7848_200\", \"7848_201\", \"7848_202\", \"7848_203\", \"7848_204\", \"7848_206\", \"7848_207\", \"7848_208\", \"7848_209\", \"7848_210\", \"7848_211\", \"7848_212\", \"7848_213\", \"7848_214\", \"7848_215\", \"7848_216\", \"7848_217\", \"7848_218\"], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 53989}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762441384969, \"message\": \"<p>For a sports retail business, Worktual can boost sales and streamline support with:</p> <ul> <li><b>Lola – Advanced conversational AI chatbot</b>: instantly handles product queries, orders and returns across chat, email, WhatsApp and SMS.</li> <li><b>AI Contact Centre</b>: unifies voice and chat for faster resolutions and lower support costs.</li> <li><b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b>: consolidates shopper data to enable personalised offers.</li> <li><b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b>: identifies repeat buyers, predicts churn and suggests loyalty rewards.</li> <li><b>Campaign Management</b>: automates targeted promotions across email, SMS and social channels.</li> </ul> <p>That’s exactly where Worktual helps — by driving measurable growth, improving customer relationships, and reducing costs.</p> <p>Which of these solutions would you like to explore further?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762441115371\", \"cookieKey\": \"b728bf1d-5393-4b9e-a520-723a99daa8d9\", \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.14.175\", \"messageID\": \"9586d5d3-911d-4aa9-91ed-44f2f081ac7b\", \"sessionId\": \"1762441115371\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24951, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 53989}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762441115371\", \"from\": \"1762441115371\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762441492635, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"Can i talk with other person !\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762441115371\", \"cookieKey\": \"b728bf1d-5393-4b9e-a520-723a99daa8d9\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.14.175\", \"messageID\": \"921e368b-e803-4814-a1d7-d298027d8ccd\", \"sessionId\": \"1762441115371\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24951, \"supervisorList\": [\"7848_200\", \"7848_201\", \"7848_202\", \"7848_203\", \"7848_204\", \"7848_206\", \"7848_207\", \"7848_208\", \"7848_209\", \"7848_210\", \"7848_211\", \"7848_212\", \"7848_213\", \"7848_214\", \"7848_215\", \"7848_216\", \"7848_217\", \"7848_218\"], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 53989}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762441494932, \"message\": \"Ofcourse! Please bear with me while I connect you to an available agent.\", \"socketId\": \"1762441115371\", \"cookieKey\": \"b728bf1d-5393-4b9e-a520-723a99daa8d9\", \"ipAddress\": \"192.168.14.175\", \"messageID\": \"19955fa8-ea2d-4682-9f56-035cc359c239\", \"sessionId\": \"1762441115371\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\