 speed and team efficiency.</li> <li><b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b>: Unifies data from all touchpoints into a single 360° view for personalised experiences.</li> <li><b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b>: Predicts churn, segments high‑value customers and drives revenue growth.</li> <li><b>Campaign Management</b>: Automates multichannel marketing campaigns, increasing engagement and conversion rates.</li> <li><b>Bespoke Solutions</b>: Tailor‑made AI applications to meet unique enterprise needs.</li> </ul> <p>Which of these solutions would you like to explore further?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762505456685\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"2f961759-5813-4edc-b6d7-49d1b583877c\", \"sessionId\": \"1762505456685\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24963, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54002}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762505456685\", \"from\": \"1762505456685\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762505572073, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"is there any free trial available for these\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762505456685\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"6804f09d-c7ef-4e4d-8fe9-628e3f8e9702\", \"sessionId\": \"1762505456685\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24963, \"supervisorList\": [], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54002}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762505581791, \"message\": \"<p>Yes – we provide a complimentary trial (typically 14 days, no‑commitment) for our core solutions, so you can experience Lola – Advanced conversational AI chatbot, the AI Contact Centre and other tools with full functionality.</p> <p>The trial includes access to analytics dashboards and dedicated support to help you maximise value.</p> <p>Would you like me to schedule a quick discussion with one of our specialists to explore this further?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762505456685\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"b7757228-9b35-440c-b18b-b4bfab9aae3b\", \"sessionId\": \"1762505456685\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24963, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54002}}}]',4,3,0,7,'2025-11-07 08:51:14','2025-11-07 08:53:12'),(54003,24964,'[{\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762506300358\", \"from\": \"1762506300358\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762506341686, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"<p>Hi there – I am Lola, your AI-powered virtual assistant at Worktual. How may I assist you today?</p>\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762506300358\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"direction\": \"AGENT\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"b2c53618-566d-4272-8e69-a381704ad7ac\", \"sessionId\": \"1762506300358\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24964, \"supervisorList\": [], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54003}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762506300358\", \"from\": \"1762506300358\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\",