\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"i am facing issues in High employee training time,Communication gap between departments (Production, QC, Store, Maintenance) and Delay in order status tracking for customers\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762507007982\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"cf4a331e-ae67-4501-8a74-78a9d1a9a3aa\", \"sessionId\": \"1762507007982\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24965, \"supervisorList\": [], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54004}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762507144469, \"message\": \"<p>I see you’re dealing with lengthy employee training, communication gaps across Production, QC, Store and Maintenance, and delays in order status tracking for customers.</p> <p>To suggest the most relevant Worktual solutions, could you let me know which industry your business operates in?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762507007982\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"6a398e3b-2683-4248-b52e-f152e550ab37\", \"sessionId\": \"1762507007982\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24965, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54004}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762507007982\", \"from\": \"1762507007982\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762507161561, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"i am from textile industry\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762507007982\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"aaf53acb-5257-4ea9-8fbf-efb0c0fdc76c\", \"sessionId\": \"1762507007982\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24965, \"supervisorList\": [], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54004}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762507176466, \"message\": \"<p>For a textile operation, Worktual can help cut training time, bridge departmental communication gaps, and speed up order‑status updates with:</p> <p><b>Lola – Advanced conversational AI chatbot</b> (instant internal assistance), <b>AI Contact Centre – Enterprise Plan</b> (unified voice & chat), <b>Ticketing System</b> (automated issue tracking), <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> (single view of all department data), <b>Bespoke Solutions</b> (tailored AI for textile workflows).</p> <p>Which of these solutions sounds most relevant to your needs?</p> <p>Would you like me to schedule a quick discussion with one of our specialists to explore this further?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762507007982\", \"cookieKey\": \"b52070f2-0877-4df9-95ff-7c52a8a1efef\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"df0d1665-0466-4bc0-ac43-b4a5ab948b53\", \"sessionId\": \"1762507007982\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24965, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54004}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762507007982\", \"from\": \"1762507007982\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762507179865, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"yes\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"