"message\": \"<p>Worktual’s suite of AI‑driven solutions transforms how businesses engage customers and streamline operations.</p> <ul> <li><b>Lola – Advanced conversational AI chatbot</b>: instant, personalised support across chat, email, WhatsApp and SMS.</li> <li><b>AI Contact Centre – Enterprise Plan</b>: unified voice and chat with AI‑guided routing and agent‑assist.</li> <li><b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b>: a single 360° view and predictive insights to boost retention and revenue.</li> <li><b>Campaign Management</b> and <b>Ticketing System</b>: automate marketing outreach and track issues end‑to‑end.</li> <li><b>Bespoke Solutions</b>: custom AI applications tailored to unique industry needs.</li> </ul> <p>Which industry does your business operate in, so I can highlight the most relevant innovations for you?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762606290966\", \"cookieKey\": \"594e8a72-e730-4557-96e4-e4d75b3a4924\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"bc34b260-6d36-4473-86be-f937d19a166e\", \"sessionId\": \"1762606290966\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24970, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54009}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762606290966\", \"from\": \"1762606290966\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762606900820, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"my company name is worktual\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762606290966\", \"cookieKey\": \"594e8a72-e730-4557-96e4-e4d75b3a4924\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"9c78a571-815c-4cf8-a482-9aa9146ecac5\", \"sessionId\": \"1762606290966\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24970, \"supervisorList\": [\"7848_200\", \"7848_201\", \"7848_202\", \"7848_203\", \"7848_205\", \"7848_206\", \"7848_207\", \"7848_208\"], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54009}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762606906553, \"message\": \"<p>Thanks for confirming your company name. Could you let me know which industry you operate in? This will help me highlight the most relevant Worktual solutions for you.</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762606290966\", \"cookieKey\": \"594e8a72-e730-4557-96e4-e4d75b3a4924\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"20f1f274-9eb2-46fc-b047-25f91629a82b\", \"sessionId\": \"1762606290966\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24970, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54009}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762606290966\", \"from\": \"1762606290966\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762607135700, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"textile industry\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762606290966\", \"cookieKey\": \"594e8a72-e730-4557-96e4-e4d75b3a4924\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"85b4fb7f-110b-4da5-9f1e-f9a522b19a21\", \"sessionId\": \"1762606290966\", \"websiteId\": \"03b5d5bb-95b1-4a7f-9ba0-ebaa4e4113ad\", \"agentIntro\": false, \"assistType\": \"Convo\", \"isCustomer\": true, \"isLiveagent\": false, \"messageType\": \"Text\", \"ChatHistoryId\": 24970, \"supervisorList\": [\"7848_200\", \"7848_201\", \"7848_202\", \"7848_203\", \"7848_205\", \"7848_206\", \"7848_207\", \"7848_208\"], \"likeDislikeStatus\": false, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54009}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"sendAt\": 1762607152471, \"message\": \"<p>For a textile business looking to cut training time and bridge communication gaps, these solutions can deliver real impact:</p> <ul> <li><b>Lola – Advanced conversational AI chatbot</b>: offers instant, on‑demand assistance to staff, ensuring consistent information across Production, QC, Store and Maintenance.</li> <li><b>AI Contact Centre – Enterprise Plan</b>: unifies voice and chat, providing real‑time context so teams collaborate smoothly and resolve queries faster.</li> <li><b>Ticketing System</b>: logs internal issues, tracks resolutions and creates transparent workflows, reducing delays and bottlenecks.</li> <li><b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b>: consolidates data from all departments into a single view, enabling better coordination and decision‑making.</li> <li><b>Bespoke Solutions</b>: custom AI modules to automate training, workflow routing and predictive maintenance for your specific processes.</li> </ul> <p>Which of these would you like to explore further?</p> \", \"socketId\": \"1762606290966\", \"cookieKey\": \"594e8a72-e730-4557-96e4-e4d75b3a4924\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"7d1d7559-76f9-4bdd-9ebd-632c24fb9d04\", \"sessionId\": \"1762606290966\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"ChatHistoryId\": 24970, \"likeDislikeStatus\": true, \"ChatDurationHistoryId\": 54009}}}, {\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"to\": \"1762606290966\", \"from\": \"1762606290966\", \"type\": \"assist\", \"isBot\": false, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"planId\": 57, \"sendAt\": 1762607239820, \"sender\": \"\", \"message\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"data\\\":\\\"could you schedule a demo for me\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}\", \"domainId\": 7848, \"fileType\": \"\", \"language\": \"en\", \"socketId\": \"1762606290966\", \"cookieKey\": \"594e8a72-e730-4557-96e4-e4d75b3a4924\", \"direction\": \"IN\", \"ipAddress\": \"182.66.104.114\", \"messageID\": \"542879a7-253e-4a9e-87b2-ddd95bfcb94c\", \"sessionId\": \"1762606290966\", \"websiteId\": \"03b