kySzQtddcMKTyunnCcq3pfATXdnxS9QPGbGVJvLhcEDU8c5rL%252BMK7R4agypzvxQxkPI4UGaFv11UpUKqkk6FbnEjj4uGjrboKmDWoOmLmb%252FALZW3I3PZUmu6kiTkZjTZ9oghfH33m%26utm_campaign%3Dhfdigestpins%26e_t%3D89cd88d8f74b4249a53fd4bf287d58f1%26e_t_s%3Dfooter%26utm_source%3D31%26utm_medium%3D2004\", \"subject\": \"Inspired by Yaswanth\", \"fromData\": \"\\\"Pinterest\\\" <recommendations@discover.pinterest.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<20251202164011.e89391cde24ae5e0@discover.pinterest.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}]','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8861,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241161, \"toData\": \"yaswanthmg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"KaggleHi Yaswanthguna,We\'re partnering with Google DeepMind to host an upcoming two-day hackathon this weekend around the launch of Gemini 3 Pro, Gemini\'s most intelligent, capable and versatile model yet.As part of this collaboration, a special tier of the Gemini API will be unlocked for all participants during this hackathon.📌 Hackathon Dates: December 5 – 7, 2025🎁 Prizes: $500,000 in Gemini API creditsFull participation details will be shared on December 5, but we wanted to give you an early heads-up so you can plan ahead.We look forward to seeing the innovative solutions you create!Ashley OldacreKaggle CompetitionsKaggle, Inc 1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy Mountain View, CA 94043This email was sent to yaswanthmg1@gmail.com because you indicated that you\'d like to receive news and updates about Kaggle. If you don\'t want to receive these emails in the future, please unsubscribe here. You can also change your preferences on your account\'s profile page by logging in at kaggle.com.\", \"subject\": \"📌 Mark Your Calendar: Google DeepMind – Build the Future with Gemini 3 Pro Hackathon\", \"fromData\": \"\\\"Kaggle\\\" <no-reply@kaggle.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<51576e57802f75931c5e88b33460b0f2483521f5-20378019-111735970@google.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8862,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241179, \"toData\": \"yaswanthmg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"Hello Yaswanth,We\'ve updated settings that manage personalisation and activity history on Play. You\'ll have dedicated controls for personalisation on Play and for saving activity in your Google Account\'s Play History, and these settings will be easily accessible in the Google Play menu.In the past, personalisation and history on Play were managed by Web & App Activity (WAA) settings in your Google Account. Going forwards, WAA will no longer control Play personalisation and Play History. Instead, you\'ll be able to manage those settings directly on Play, and you\'ll see this change in your account in the next few days. Learn more about Play personalisation and Play History <http://support.google.com/googleplay?p=personalize_play_migration>When the transition happens for your account, your Play settings will be based on the most recent choice that you made in WAA, so your experience will stay the same. If you have WAA turned on during the transition, which is happening over the next few days, then your Play personalisation and Play History settings will be on, and if WAA is off, then Play personalisation and Play History will be off. As before, you’ll be able to choose how long your activity is saved in your Play History and if you want to delete it from Play History manually or automatically.After the transition is complete, WAA and Play settings will be separate, and changes to one will no longer affect the other. You can view and change your Play privacy settings in Personalisation in Play <https://myactivity.google.com/product/google_play/personalization> at any time. Learn more about the transition and how it affects your settings <http://support.google.com/googleplay?p=personalize_play_migration>Thanks for using Google Play!Should you have any questions, please visit our Help Centre <https://notifications.google.com/g/p/ANiao5oRRq0eA50bEW-9D6N8upfeW0HxV9wA8lODs7ab7yXcEGdX4w9LZlb2nqrA_AOfq5sTY9uOrLIo_xwFMd0jwS-ZJjgn5mC31z45ySqgAxrUqqKmZffjVnKgDTHP0n98QE9pfdosCDug9oLl6zGrTWp1YmCRbF08dSqMA7Xh5VNswNToSKdgkyO_7XMQQBZfbSS8OD-Pq1ZDTswBPvMSZhz0fTytvSaU8B9Cuqv7IWUnQpnDg9wizn3gEdkfy8s19Tz4> or get in touch <https://notifications.google.com/g/p/ANiao5ppRjSyPEnzO-QKibVlGE7VlQnOpxw-BlC0rQ5RFGPruxzVOep0mY6k5PZGJtQZw5w_MzhxnoTKwfDhzX-oDXDtjuShn1EldBJkXI3-ys2a41YodB0UXVbY_V1G4hq9PGv9I2iNjQ-mgDIpPPpC9LzqIX5KmMzPgceOJhZncoAmd2wWyr1lwTjIiP7HRueIo8GA02qPiQAJDRdUCrqh0h8gFje2Ga3nZFtMLCCzlij7WNdoYEDQ94BfFIAh>.(c) 2025 Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043, USAYou have received this mandatory email service announcement to update you about important changes to your Play product or account.Please do not reply to this email, as we are unable to respond from this email address. If you need support, please visit the Google Play Help Centre <https://support.google.com/googleplay>.\", \"subject\": \"Updates to how privacy settings work on Play\", \"fromData\": \"\\\"Google Play\\\" <googleplay-noreply@google.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<0d8e68f3e019057dd7539a0fd5063ecf6ad0ff24-20382279-987377478@google.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8863,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241193, \"toData\": \"yaswanthmg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"KaggleHi Yaswanthguna,We\'re excited to announce that Kaggle\'s 5-Day AI Agents Intensive Course with Google is now available as a self-paced Learn Guide!This live event was held from November 10 - 14, 2025, and is now made available as a self-paced learning guide for anyone interested in building and deploying AI agents.Access Learn Guide HereIn this guide, you\'ll learn:Introduction to AgentsAgent Tools & Interoperability with MCPContext Engineering: Sessions & MemoryAgent QualityPrototype to ProductionAccess whitepapers, podcasts, codelabs and recorded livestreams - all designed to deepen your AI agents expertise. Join Kaggle\'s Discord to collaborate with other learners.Happy learning!The Kaggle TeamKaggle, Inc 1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy Mountain View, CA 94043This email was sent to yaswanthmg1@gmail.com because you indicated that you\'d like to receive news and updates about Kaggle. If you don\'t want to receive these emails in the future, please unsubscribe here. You can also change your preferences on your account\'s profile page by logging in at kaggle.com.\", \"subject\": \"5-Day AI Agents Intensive Course With Google - Now as a Learn Guide!\", \"fromData\": \"\\\"Kaggle\\\" <no-reply@kaggle.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<bfc8a0f81a31481fe89f4033db569da9becc2ad5-20373781-111735955@google.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8864,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241211, \"toData\": \"yaswanthmg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"KaggleHi Yaswanthguna,It\'s here! Solve real-world problems and bring your ideas to life in the Google DeepMind - Vibe Code with Gemini 3 Pro in AI Studio hackathon. Use Gemini 3 Pro\'s advanced reasoning and native multimodality to build applications in AI Studio across science, education, health, accessibility, business and technology.You can use the special tier in Google AI Studio to prototype quickly, explore templates and vibe code solutions directly from idea to functional applicationTotal Prizes:$500,000 in CreditsHackathon Timeline:Dec 5 - 12, 2025 (now extended!)Learn MoreYour work can accelerate discovery, improve lives and demonstrate the potential of AI-powered applications built with Gemini 3 Pro.Good luck,Ashley OldacreKaggle CompetitionsKaggle, Inc 1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy Mountain View, CA 94043This email was sent to yaswanthmg1@gmail.com because you indicated that you\'d like to receive news and updates about Kaggle. If you don\'t want to receive these emails in the future, please unsubscribe here. You can also change your preferences on your account\'s profile page by logging in at kaggle.com.\", \"subject\": \"Hackath