adline:March 18, 2026Learn MoreYour work will help establish the structural foundation needed for RNA-based therapies, directly accelerating the discovery of new medical treatments.Good luck,Walter ReadeKaggle Data ScientistKaggle, Inc 1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy Mountain View, CA 94043This email was sent to yaswanthmg1@gmail.com because you indicated that you\'d like to receive news and updates about Kaggle. If you don\'t want to receive these emails in the future, please unsubscribe here. You can also change your preferences on your account\'s profile page by logging in at kaggle.com.\", \"subject\": \"Competition Launch: Stanford RNA 3D Folding Part 2\", \"fromData\": \"\\\"Kaggle\\\" <no-reply@kaggle.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<2a4d41dc9cbdee37c2e26869baee87f700da378f-20391111-111800328@google.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8887,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241639, \"toData\": \"yaswanthmg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"Upgrade now for advanced access to AI toolsChatGPT Business Logo[http://cdn.mcauto-images-production.sendgrid.net/d4ef4a73d51fe844/9e893feb-225c-41e0-a0cd-1ec4105f047b/190x34.png]http://url3243.email.openai.com/ls/click?upn=u001.xyUm3sue4bTsczsfKDq1pymnrbEwTLamylFTMoDE9iU3zC93z86zJJ9-2B903i38sO9MdF1T5zqAAzc4SGROeG4RBJIWeu7MaZbn7gzWbth29WspssFwI0-2FLkDtid1xSewT29sPlwhSxs8h1P5Odw46eRF1ao4So3OdKeicxmhIY-2FTAFsamO-2FyoYhT0sUhiQHNgLcJ_t-2B6lgQGv4S9LA7AQNx5XMKL15-2BqdNqbXiRtVTnZkV7M372afvq-2B6DW6KMdAcO-2Bu1-2BeUvcP17FA5sZqHb5BSIygx3vNU8Ppj4tIsHC-2FaHuSIPhr6xMP9WEi1sDnUuMeraNgl-2FlA6XrtcMhKEw0nUHAzxMSZ5YhGfYJa5tpGdZoJBD5tCjjSIFFXVeQx06beT9UpML-2FPl-2BNaKUn0h2bx5IGkKqQJERZ0s5B-2FjILnP4UfnZolKDe3ELQDANnigM-2FoF1EdekLlcgGsE2bZbvpfeVhLr3KKJPMiySpPW4vQzxu9kxYEz3Y9zn9e9iGVatrhZkHiZlJXuPr2RNPF1CBgjqSTGvXxWkEBPhNfPHV93JjSBK32-2B88su3Y5p3-2F2WJOfIV6VRU4rc8U9ONFvYS4ja05abYMKoG20qTLjTZszBzIbfiM5eQEX3spcMvx1md4fRcwpCuAizNNWzCAZzBIcJEWpP-2FwxF3S4NEWh-2FB6IBWIqe2kLEWiSpj-2BHpmboIeilZzPAUGuL4stR0mE9QgsamLZfjs3