gle.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<bc726336c75086ce2f991a83e07d69f30d3122e7-20372932-111740075@google.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8898,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241724, \"toData\": \"yaswanthmg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"Logo[https://t0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&url=https://www.worktual.co.uk]WorktualHello Yaswanth, hope you\'re thriving!Unlock a 22% sales boost with AI‑driven automation – book your free demo now!Campaign Image[https://nlp-storage.worktual.co.uk/wsnlp/campaign_images/image_20260122_045305.png]Book a Free Demo[https://nlpcampaign.worktual.co.uk/click_rate?email=yaswanthmg1@gmail.com&campaign_id=2238&domain_id=20184&redirect_url=https://www.worktual.co.uk&utm_source=worktualcampaign&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=LeadBoostSummer Sale&temptype=B][https://nlpcampaign.worktual.co.uk/open_rate?email=yaswanthmg1@gmail.com&campaign_id=2238&domain_id=20184&temptype=B]Unsubscribe[https://nlpcampaign.worktual.co.uk/unsubscribe_email?domain_id=20184&campaign_id=2238&email=yaswanthmg1@gmail.com&redirect_url=https://worktual.co.uk/unsubscribe&temptype=B]\", \"subject\": \"Boost Your Sales with AI‑Powered Automation\", \"fromData\": \"\\\"Worktual Team\\\" <contact@em.worktual.tech>\", \"messageId\": \"<0e7dab18-f1d7-db4e-0f99-e81162e0089a@em.worktual.tech>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-01-27 06:10:41','2026-01-27 06:10:41'),(8899,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1769494241730, \"toData\": \"yaswanth.mg1@gmail.com\", \"message\": \"Logo[https://t0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&url=https://www.worktual.co.uk]WorktualHello Yaswanth, hope you\'re thriving!Unlock a 22% sales boost with AI‑driven automation – book your free demo now!Campaign Image[https://nlp-storage.worktual.co.uk/wsnlp/campaign_images/image_20260122_045305.png]Book a Free Demo[https://nlpcampaign.worktual.co.uk/click_rate?