nclude:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Multiple key slots, allowing multiple users to have separate passwords</li>\\n<li>Support for various encryption algorithms and modes</li>\\n<li>Ability to change or add passwords without having to re-encrypt the data</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>If you have any specific questions about <b>LUKS</b> or disk encryption in general, feel free to ask and I\'ll do my best to help.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"8172e17c-6892-41a0-93e5-89a9a24281c5\", \"sessionId\": \"0b814dd7-e250-46d4-8982-68043d9f9c79\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"I\'m not familiar with the term \\\"luks\\\"\"}}}]','2026-02-09 09:18:11','2026-02-09 09:18:18'),(9056,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1770628699549, \"toData\": \"k.sekar@worktual.com\", \"message\": \"Dear Customer, I\'m happy to help you with your query. The term \\\"luks\\\" refers to Linux Unified Key Setup, which is a disk encryption specification that allows multiple users to have separate passwords to unlock a disk.\\n It\'s a way to secure your data by encrypting it, and it\'s commonly used in Linux systems. If you\'re interested in learning more about LUKS and how it works, I can try to provide more information or point you in the direction of some resources.\\n Some key features of LUKS include:\\n Multiple key slots, allowing multiple users to have separate passwords Support for various encryption algorithms and modes Ability to change or add passwords without having to re-encrypt the data If you have any specific questions about LUKS or disk encryption in general, feel free to ask and I\'ll do my best to help.\\nThanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT\", \"subject\": \"I\'m not familiar with the term \\\"luks\\\"\", \"fromData\": \"financeteam@worktual.co.uk\", \"messageId\": \"<CWLP123MB55877C68CB095C3F1115623F9065A@CWLP123MB5587.GBRP123.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>\", \"attachments\"