Campaign Management</b>: Easily create, schedule, and oversee campaigns across multiple channels, reaching your audience precisely using tools designed for consistency, timing, and easily generated campaigns.</li>\\n    <li><b>Lola - Advanced Chatbot</b>: Understands subtle cues like intent, tone, and complexity, driving lead generation and enabling businesses to manage thousands of chats efficiently, delivering consistent, 24/7 support.</li>\\n    <li><b>Lukas - Standard Chatbot</b>: Manages routine tasks like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment processing across web, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Meta platforms.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>For more information, you can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or contact us directly to discuss your specific needs.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"c39f9d92-5dd2-4c86-841f-f320c6341ee9\", \"sessionId\": \"a5a07355-1598-4629-b7d3-1b377fe2c04e\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual related questions\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:45:47','2026-02-14 06:45:55'),(9117,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771051551803, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>can u tell about ur product</p>\", \"subject\": \"Product exploration\", \"fromData\": \"mithun nivi <mithunnivi785@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAELB6o=WDKt0788CsgJuMe5EKJP+PQNWmf6JS0jeOPWbghbdaw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"mithunnivi785@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771051559231, \"message\": \"Dear Customer,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for your interest in our products. We offer a range of innovative solutions to help businesses like yours succeed. Our main produc