b>Lukas</b> - our standard chatbot that manages routine tasks &gt; like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment &gt; processing. &gt; &gt; For more information, you can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> &gt; or check out our blog for the latest insights and trends in conversational &gt; AI and customer service at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/blog/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/blog/</a>. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Email bot testing\", \"fromData\": \"Christina Evangeline <christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CABYt-2CnCOBd2wORqB8L7fXzAO9wv1jkGekOUWQH_ib1ybgyvQ@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771051669339, \"message\": \"Dear Customer,\\n\\n<p>I apologize, but I am not trained to provide information on the specific topics of <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b> that you have inquired about.</p>\\n<p>I do not have the necessary knowledge or data to accurately answer your questions, and I do not want to provide any potentially misleading or incorrect information.</p>\\n<p>If you could provide more context or clarify what you are looking for regarding <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b>, I may be able to help you better or direct you to a resource that can assist you.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"c4661a7f-ea4a-41cb-90f4-249236b781aa\", \"sessionId\": \"fbec93ea-4631-457c-993a-d10d4e6537b6\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Email bot testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:47:42','2026-02-14 06:47:49'),(9122,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771051906841, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.