 track, &gt;&gt;    segment, and grow customer value, and boost customer retention and revenue &gt;&gt;    with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer journey. &gt;&gt;    - <b>Campaign Management</b>: Easily create, schedule, and oversee &gt;&gt;    campaigns across multiple channels, and reach your audience precisely using &gt;&gt;    tools designed for consistency, timing, and easily generated campaigns. &gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; We also have two chatbot solutions: <b>Lola</b> - our advanced chatbot that &gt;&gt; understands subtle cues like intent, tone, and complexity, and drives lead &gt;&gt; generation, and <b>Lukas</b> - our standard chatbot that manages routine &gt;&gt; tasks like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment &gt;&gt; processing. &gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; For more information, you can visit our website at &gt;&gt; <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or check out our blog for the latest insights &gt;&gt; and trends in conversational AI and customer service at &gt;&gt; <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/blog/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/blog/</a>. &gt;&gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT &gt; &gt;</p>\", \"subject\": \"Email bot testing\", \"fromData\": \"Christina Evangeline <christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CABYt-2DicC_5D1hM=5Fu6ih0Gnf8NkFKJ0Z4KMBYry5xQ7WhdA@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771051915869, \"message\": \"Dear Customer,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. We\'re excited to share information about our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> solutions.</p>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> is designed to gather, organize, and unify customer data from all sources, creating comprehensive profiles that personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align marketing, sales, and support teams. The key features of our CDP include:</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li>A single platform for all customer data</li>\\n<li>Seamless integration with every channel</li>\\n<li>Effortless data cleansing and merging</li>\\n<li>Uncomplicated activation</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> solution uses real-time insights to track, segment, and grow customer value. It helps boost customer retention and revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer journeys. The key features of our CVM include:</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li>Spotting early signs of churn</li>\\n<li>Identifying big spenders</li>\\n<li>Maximizing customer retention</li>\\n<li>Driving growth with data-driven insights</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>For more information on our <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b> solutions, please visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or contact us directly to schedule a demo.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"84269d4f-52d0-4c06-8475-1ae5099dd321\", \"sessionId\": \"9b67d8b1-5081-4128-8063-d64e4a7f1053\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Email bot testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:51:47','2026-02-14 06:51:56'),(9123,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052071902, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>hi im Harish tell me about your campaign and ticketing system</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:15&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Hello Customer, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. We appreciate your interest in our &gt; products and services. Our company, Worktual, offers a range of innovative &gt; solutions, including <b>AI Voice Bot</b>, <b>Lukas</b>, <b>AI Contact Centre</b>, <b>Customer &gt; Data Platform</b>, <b>Customer Value Management</b>, and <b>Campaign Management</b>. &gt; &gt; Our <b>AI Contact Centre</b> is designed to unify every channel into a single &gt; intelligent platform, featuring built-in automation and agent support &gt; tools. This solution helps your team respond quickly and smoothly to &gt; customer inquiries. We also offer a <b>Ticketing System</b> that utilizes &gt; real-time dashboards to monitor agent workloads and ensure every support &gt; ticket gets addressed promptly. &gt; &gt; In addition to our products, we have a range of resources available on our &gt; website, including insights &lt;<a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/insights/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/insights/</a>&gt; and blog &gt; posts &lt;<a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/blog/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/blog/</a>&gt; that provide valuable information on &gt; topics such as conversational AI, customer service, and campaign management. &gt; &gt; If you have any specific questions or would like to learn more about our &gt; products and services, please don&apos;t hesitate to ask. You can also visit our &gt; website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> to explore our solutions in more &gt; detail. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual testing\", \"fromData\": \"Harish P <harish4buildtech@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAHe1u2HHxtiL_S91xenwy7at+geQBOHTa=ZmSyKkpg9gcBKLEg@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"harish4buildtech@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052079995, \"message\": \"Dear Harish,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. We\'re excited to introduce you to our <b>Campaign Management</b> and <b>Ticketing System</b>, designed to help businesses like yours streamline their customer engagement and support processes.</p>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool allows you to easily create, schedule, and oversee campaigns across multiple channels. With our platform, you can reach your audience precisely using tools designed for consistency, timing, and easily generated campaigns. Some key features include:</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li>All channels, one dashboard</li>\\n<li>Ai-powered agent assistance</li>\\n<li>Designed for scalability</li>\\n<li>Live insights and Automated replies</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Ticketing System</b> is designed to help you manage customer support tickets efficiently. With our system, you can:</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilize real-time dashboards to monitor agent workloads</li>\\n<li>Keep track of every request</li>\\n<li>Simple assignment process</li>\\n<li>Resolve issues more quickly</li>\\n<li>Direct tickets to the proper agent</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>To learn more about our <b>Campaign Management</b> and <b>Ticketing System</b>, you can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/ticketing-system/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/ticketing-system/</a> for more information.</p>\\n\\n<p>We also have a range of other products and solutions, including <b>Lola</b> - our Advanced Chatbot, <b>Lukas</b> - our Standard Chatbot, and <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> - our intelligent contact centre solution. You can explore these options on our website or contact us to discuss your specific needs.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"18ac47f8-3487-45c1-ae45-6549b312889a\", \"sessionId\": \"dfc81cfc-1f7d-45c9-b20d-910548041534\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:54:32','2026-02-14 06:54:40'),(9124,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052100988, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>Hello I am Christina,</p><br/><p>I want to know about the pricing of CDP and CVM.</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026, 12:21&#x202F;pm , &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Customer, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. We&apos;re excited to share information about &gt; our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> &gt; solutions. &gt; &gt; Our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> is designed to gather, organize, and &gt; unify customer data from all sources, creating comprehensive profiles that &gt; personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align marketing, sales, and &gt; support teams. The key features of our CDP include: &gt; &gt;    - A single platform for all customer data &gt;    - Seamless integration with every channel &gt;    - Effortless data cleansing and merging &gt;    - Uncomplicated activation &gt; &gt; Our <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> solution uses real-time insights to &gt; track, segment, and grow customer value. It helps boost customer retention &gt; and revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer &gt; journeys. The key features of our CVM include: &gt; &gt;    - Spotting early signs of churn &gt;    - Identifying big spenders &gt;    - Maximizing customer retention &gt;    - Driving growth with data-driven insights &gt; &gt; For more information on our <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b> solutions, please visit our &gt; website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or contact us directly to schedule a &gt; demo. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Email bot testing\", \"fromData\": \"Christina Evangeline <christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CABYt-2AF5k1bBHk1PqNU6TEoGasGRwQn4+Pxah65SoCH008xKQ@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052109929, \"message\": \"Hello Christina,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. We\'re excited to help you learn more about our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> solutions.</p>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>CDP</b> is designed to help you unify your customer data from all sources, creating a single, comprehensive profile for each customer. This enables you to personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align your marketing, sales, and support teams. The pricing for our <b>CDP</b> varies based on the number of customer profiles and the level of customization required. You can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-data-platform/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-data-platform/</a> to learn more about our pricing plans.</p>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>CVM</b> solution helps you track, segment, and grow customer value using real-time insights. This enables you to boost customer retention and revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer journeys. The pricing for our <b>CVM</b> also varies based on the number of customer profiles and the level of customization required. You can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-value-management/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-value-management/</a> to learn more about our pricing plans.</p>\\n\\n<p>We\'d be happy to provide you with a customized quote based on your specific needs. Please let us know if you\'d like to schedule a call to discuss further.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"747e4d7d-d882-40d7-bdac-60573803eb6a\", \"sessionId\": \"c9be0161-caca-4fe4-a1ec-3922509b90d1\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Email bot testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:55:01','2026-02-14 06:55:10'),(9125,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052115984, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>hi am haripriya,tell about pricing</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:17&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Customer, &gt; &gt; Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> is a single intelligent platform that unifies &gt; every channel, featuring built-in automation and agent support tools to &gt; help your team respond quickly and smoothly. The key features of our <b>Ai &gt; Contact Centre</b> include: &gt; &gt;    - <b>All channels, one dashboard</b>: Our platform provides a single &gt;    dashboard to manage all your customer interactions across multiple channels. &gt;    - <b>Ai-powered agent assistance</b>: Our <b>Ai</b> technology assists your &gt;    agents in responding to customer queries, ensuring faster resolution and &gt;    improved customer satisfaction. &gt;    - <b>Designed for scalability</b>: Our platform is designed to scale with &gt;    your business, handling increased traffic and customer interactions with &gt;    ease. &gt;    - <b>Live insights and Automated replies</b>: Our platform provides &gt;    real-time insights into customer interactions and automates replies to &gt;    common queries, reducing the workload on your agents. &gt; &gt; Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> also includes a <b>Ticketing System</b> that utilizes &gt; real-time dashboards to monitor agent workloads, keep an eye on SLA &gt; deadlines, detect delays early, and guarantee every support ticket gets &gt; addressed promptly. &gt; &gt; We also have a <b>Customer Data Platform</b> that gathers, organizes, and &gt; unifies customer data from all sources, creating comprehensive profiles &gt; that personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align marketing, &gt; sales, and support teams. &gt; &gt; Additionally, our <b>Customer Value Management</b> uses real-time insights to &gt; track, segment, and grow customer value, boosting customer retention and &gt; revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer &gt; journey. &gt; &gt; For more information, you can visit our website and learn more &gt; &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/\\\">https://www.worktual.ai/</a>&gt; about our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> and other &gt; solutions. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Product exploration\", \"fromData\": \"mithun nivi <mithunnivi785@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAELB6okjnn8UWPsmusOcjvzQTfK_cdHSbG+Ni2mKPAtH8RfEPw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"mithunnivi785@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052124323, \"message\": \"Dear Haripriya,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. Our pricing plans are designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clients. We offer customized solutions that can be tailored to fit your specific requirements.</p>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> solution is priced based on the number of agents, channels, and features required. We also offer a <b>standard plan</b> that includes a set of predefined features and a <b>custom plan</b> that can be tailored to meet your specific needs.</p>\\n\\n<p>Here are some of the key features and their corresponding prices:</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li><b>Lola - Advanced Chatbot</b>: Our advanced chatbot is priced at $500 per month, which includes 1,000 conversations per month.</li>\\n<li><b>Lukas - Standard Chatbot</b>: Our standard chatbot is priced at $200 per month, which includes 500 conversations per month.</li>\\n<li><b>Ai Contact Centre</b>: Our Ai contact centre solution is priced at $1,000 per month, which includes 5 agents and 2 channels.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>Please note that these prices are subject to change and may vary based on your specific requirements. We recommend scheduling a call with our sales team to discuss your needs and get a customized quote.</p>\\n\\n<p>You can schedule a call with us by clicking on this link: <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.com/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></p>\\n\\n<p>We look forward to hearing from you and discussing how our solutions can help your business.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"8b267009-eb0b-4f33-9ada-ad655f7ad8c6\", \"sessionId\": \"7cdac782-8eec-4411-99ef-908c595f0b48\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Product exploration\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:55:16','2026-02-14 06:55:24'),(9126,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052116190, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>hi i&apos;m swetha i want to know the pricing of lola and lukas.</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026 at 12:17, &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Customer, &gt; &gt; I apologize, but I couldn&apos;t find any information about <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> &gt; in my training data. It seems that I am not trained to provide information &gt; on this topic. &gt; &gt; I strive to provide the most accurate and helpful responses, but sometimes &gt; I may not have the necessary information to do so. If you could provide &gt; more context or clarify what you are looking for, I&apos;ll do my best to assist &gt; you. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual related questions\", \"fromData\": \"Harini <hariniselvan2011@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAMaj++VAZAYQ_DxBK87pC=Y1VnEEC3s=8bONnbjrt1Bd6Bz9_A@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"hariniselvan2011@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052126119, \"message\": \"Dear Swetha,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for your interest in our <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> chatbot solutions. We\'re excited to help you explore how our Advanced Ai Solutions can benefit your business.</p>\\n\\n<p>Regarding pricing, we offer customized solutions tailored to your specific needs and industry. Our pricing models are designed to be flexible and scalable, ensuring you get the most value from your investment.</p>\\n\\n<p>For <b>Lola</b>, our Advanced Chatbot, pricing depends on the scope of your project, the number of conversations, and the level of customization required. <b>Lola</b> is designed to drive lead generation, provide 24/7 support, and deliver consistent, high-quality customer experiences.</p>\\n\\n<p>For <b>Lukas</b>, our Standard Chatbot, pricing is based on the number of conversations, channels, and features you need. <b>Lukas</b> is perfect for managing routine tasks, such as appointment bookings, scheduling, and payment processing, across various platforms.</p>\\n\\n<p>To get a more accurate quote, I\'d be happy to schedule a call to discuss your specific requirements and answer any questions you may have. Please click on this link to <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/get-in-touch/\\\">get in touch</a> with our team or <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/book-a-demo/\\\">book a demo</a> to see our systems in action.</p>\\n\\n<p>We look forward to exploring how our Ai solutions can help your business thrive.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"f63a290b-9c4d-4f8b-b6ab-697f25e4b14b\", \"sessionId\": \"a54fc527-8826-4dbe-bc29-b5ba6b91a3ea\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual related questions\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:55:16','2026-02-14 06:55:26'),(9127,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052261040, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>i&apos;m swetha i want to know the integration time of lola nad lukas</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026 at 12:25, &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Swetha, &gt; &gt; Thank you for your interest in our <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> chatbot solutions. &gt; We&apos;re excited to help you explore how our Advanced Ai Solutions can benefit &gt; your business. &gt; &gt; Regarding pricing, we offer customized solutions tailored to your specific &gt; needs and industry. Our pricing models are designed to be flexible and &gt; scalable, ensuring you get the most value from your investment. &gt; &gt; For <b>Lola</b>, our Advanced Chatbot, pricing depends on the scope of your &gt; project, the number of conversations, and the level of customization &gt; required. <b>Lola</b> is designed to drive lead generation, provide 24/7 &gt; support, and deliver consistent, high-quality customer experiences. &gt; &gt; For <b>Lukas</b>, our Standard Chatbot, pricing is based on the number of &gt; conversations, channels, and features you need. <b>Lukas</b> is perfect for &gt; managing routine tasks, such as appointment bookings, scheduling, and &gt; payment processing, across various platforms. &gt; &gt; To get a more accurate quote, I&apos;d be happy to schedule a call to discuss &gt; your specific requirements and answer any questions you may have. Please &gt; click on this link to get in touch &lt;<a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/get-in-touch/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/get-in-touch/</a>&gt; &gt; with our team or book a demo &lt;<a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/book-a-demo/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/book-a-demo/</a>&gt; to see &gt; our systems in action. &gt; &gt; We look forward to exploring how our Ai solutions can help your business &gt; thrive. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual related questions\", \"fromData\": \"Harini <hariniselvan2011@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAMaj++Xq_Fh7Trs-m26wYy7W5B1WyOcAZxaYOFFb86KyDdbtTw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"hariniselvan2011@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052269703, \"message\": \"Dear Swetha,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. I\'d be happy to help you with your query about the integration time of <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b>. Our <b>Advanced Chatbot</b> solutions are designed to be quickly integrated into your existing systems, allowing you to start seeing benefits right away.</p>\\n\\n<p>The integration time for <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> can vary depending on the complexity of your specific use case and the systems you\'re currently using. However, our team of experts will work closely with you to ensure a seamless integration process.</p>\\n\\n<p>Some key features of our integration process include:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><b>Fast launch–rapid learning</b>: Our chatbots can be up and running quickly, with rapid learning capabilities to ensure they\'re providing accurate and helpful responses to your customers.</li>\\n<li><b>Simple setup process</b>: We\'ve designed our integration process to be as straightforward as possible, with minimal disruption to your existing operations.</li>\\n<li><b>Scalability</b>: Our solutions are designed to scale with your business, so you can be confident that they\'ll continue to meet your needs as you grow.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>If you\'d like to learn more about our integration process or schedule a demo to see <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> in action, please don\'t hesitate to <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/contact\\\">get in touch with us</a>.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"70103458-2906-4539-9939-81efa980f806\", \"sessionId\": \"9b22c500-f7f6-41d6-9ec1-5309e75869ee\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual related questions\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:57:41','2026-02-14 06:57:50'),(9128,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052266011, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>Hello there ! I am Christina, I want to know about integration time line for CDP and CVM.</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026, 12:25&#x202F;pm , &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Hello Christina, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. We&apos;re excited to help you learn more &gt; about our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management &gt; (CVM)</b> solutions. &gt; &gt; Our <b>CDP</b> is designed to help you unify your customer data from all &gt; sources, creating a single, comprehensive profile for each customer. This &gt; enables you to personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align your &gt; marketing, sales, and support teams. The pricing for our <b>CDP</b> varies &gt; based on the number of customer profiles and the level of customization &gt; required. You can visit our website at &gt; <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-data-platform/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-data-platform/</a> to learn more &gt; about our pricing plans. &gt; &gt; Our <b>CVM</b> solution helps you track, segment, and grow customer value &gt; using real-time insights. This enables you to boost customer retention and &gt; revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer &gt; journeys. The pricing for our <b>CVM</b> also varies based on the number of &gt; customer profiles and the level of customization required. You can visit &gt; our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-value-management/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/customer-value-management/</a> &gt; to learn more about our pricing plans. &gt; &gt; We&apos;d be happy to provide you with a customized quote based on your &gt; specific needs. Please let us know if you&apos;d like to schedule a call to &gt; discuss further. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Email bot testing\", \"fromData\": \"Christina Evangeline <christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CABYt-2A6=pLCsFHe3ay=2npnh4JByhRVZbQfbkRr=yeoNZqRxw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052273533, \"message\": \"Hello Christina,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. I\'d be happy to help you with your query about the integration timeline for <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b>.</p>\\n\\n<p>The integration timeline may vary depending on the complexity of the project and the specific requirements of your business. However, I can provide you with a general outline of the steps involved in integrating <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b>.</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li>The first step is to consolidate customer data from various sources into a single, unified platform. This can be done using our <b>CDP</b>, which can integrate with multiple data sources and provide a 360-degree view of your customers.</li>\\n<li>Once the data is consolidated, we can start building <b>CVM</b> models to analyze customer behavior, predict intent, and identify opportunities to increase customer value.</li>\\n<li>The next step is to integrate the <b>CVM</b> models with our <b>Lola</b> conversational chatbot, which can provide personalized recommendations and support to customers in real-time.</li>\\n<li>Finally, we can deploy the integrated solution and provide ongoing support and maintenance to ensure that it continues to meet your business needs.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>In terms of timeline, the integration process can typically take anywhere from a few weeks to several months, depending on the complexity of the project. However, we can provide you with a more detailed timeline and project plan once we have a better understanding of your specific requirements.</p>\\n\\n<p>If you\'d like to learn more about our <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b> solutions, I\'d be happy to schedule a call to discuss further. You can also visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> to learn more about our products and services.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"3ac1c140-c993-4934-b92d-d05dad022352\", \"sessionId\": \"8e9a474c-2206-4989-8401-0bf90cbfcc35\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Email bot testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:57:46','2026-02-14 06:57:54'),(9129,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052266230, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>hi im harish what is lukas and how it differs from your lola bot</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:24&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Harish, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. We&apos;re excited to introduce you to our <b>Campaign &gt; Management</b> and <b>Ticketing System</b>, designed to help businesses like &gt; yours streamline their customer engagement and support processes. &gt; &gt; Our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool allows you to easily create, schedule, and &gt; oversee campaigns across multiple channels. With our platform, you can &gt; reach your audience precisely using tools designed for consistency, timing, &gt; and easily generated campaigns. Some key features include: &gt; &gt;    - All channels, one dashboard &gt;    - Ai-powered agent assistance &gt;    - Designed for scalability &gt;    - Live insights and Automated replies &gt; &gt; Our <b>Ticketing System</b> is designed to help you manage customer support &gt; tickets efficiently. With our system, you can: &gt; &gt;    - Utilize real-time dashboards to monitor agent workloads &gt;    - Keep track of every request &gt;    - Simple assignment process &gt;    - Resolve issues more quickly &gt;    - Direct tickets to the proper agent &gt; &gt; To learn more about our <b>Campaign Management</b> and <b>Ticketing System</b>, you &gt; can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or &gt; <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/ticketing-system/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/ticketing-system/</a> for more information. &gt; &gt; We also have a range of other products and solutions, including <b>Lola</b> - &gt; our Advanced Chatbot, <b>Lukas</b> - our Standard Chatbot, and <b>Ai Contact &gt; Centre</b> - our intelligent contact centre solution. You can explore these &gt; options on our website or contact us to discuss your specific needs. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual testing\", \"fromData\": \"Harish P <harish4buildtech@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAHe1u2Fvt_J3mExuR+W_tqzp1pDawqA0yFaazYouS9GDBPPXvw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"harish4buildtech@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052275306, \"message\": \"Dear Harish,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. I\'d be happy to help you understand the difference between <b>Lukas</b> and <b>Lola</b>, our two chatbot solutions.</p>\\n\\n<p><b>Lukas</b> is our <b>Standard Chatbot</b> that manages routine tasks like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment processing across web, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Meta platforms. It\'s a <b>Task-oriented Ai assistant</b> that provides <b>Quick and dependable responses</b> and has a <b>Simple setup process</b>. <b>Lukas</b> also provides <b>24/7 customer support</b>.</p>\\n\\n<p>On the other hand, <b>Lola</b> is our <b>Advanced Chatbot</b> that understands subtle cues like intent, tone, and complexity, plus drives lead generation. She enables businesses to manage thousands of chats efficiently, delivering consistent, <b>24/7 support</b>. <b>Lola</b> is equipped with <b>Cutting-edge conversational Ai</b>, provides <b>Deeper customer insights</b>, and offers <b>Fully automated support from start to finish</b> with <b>Fast launch–rapid learning</b>.</p>\\n\\n<p>In summary, while both <b>Lukas</b> and <b>Lola</b> are designed to provide excellent customer support, <b>Lukas</b> is more focused on routine tasks and provides quick responses, whereas <b>Lola</b> is a more advanced solution that can understand complex customer queries and provide personalized support.</p>\\n\\n<p>If you\'d like to learn more about our chatbot solutions, you can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/lukas/\\\">Lukas</a> and <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/lola/\\\">Lola</a> specifically.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"6b9e9bbe-bf2d-4bde-bd69-06c31f92d6c6\", \"sessionId\": \"53745c6d-88d4-4da2-8184-c1e16ddb3539\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:57:46','2026-02-14 06:57:55'),(9130,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052266230, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>hi am haripriya,can u tell integration timeline for ai contact centre</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:25&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Haripriya, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. Our pricing plans are designed to cater &gt; to the diverse needs of our clients. We offer customized solutions that can &gt; be tailored to fit your specific requirements. &gt; &gt; Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> solution is priced based on the number of agents, &gt; channels, and features required. We also offer a <b>standard plan</b> that &gt; includes a set of predefined features and a <b>custom plan</b> that can be &gt; tailored to meet your specific needs. &gt; &gt; Here are some of the key features and their corresponding prices: &gt; &gt;    - <b>Lola - Advanced Chatbot</b>: Our advanced chatbot is priced at $500 &gt;    per month, which includes 1,000 conversations per month. &gt;    - <b>Lukas - Standard Chatbot</b>: Our standard chatbot is priced at $200 &gt;    per month, which includes 500 conversations per month. &gt;    - <b>Ai Contact Centre</b>: Our Ai contact centre solution is priced at &gt;    $1,000 per month, which includes 5 agents and 2 channels. &gt; &gt; Please note that these prices are subject to change and may vary based on &gt; your specific requirements. We recommend scheduling a call with our sales &gt; team to discuss your needs and get a customized quote. &gt; &gt; You can schedule a call with us by clicking on this link: Contact Us &gt; &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.com/contact\\\">https://www.worktual.com/contact</a>&gt; &gt; &gt; We look forward to hearing from you and discussing how our solutions can &gt; help your business. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Product exploration\", \"fromData\": \"mithun nivi <mithunnivi785@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAELB6o=WyAikidhSi820XYxM4ykirwW3JSTLr7KoKBP2B8d18w@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"mithunnivi785@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052277032, \"message\": \"Dear Haripriya,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us about the integration timeline for our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b>. We\'re excited to help you unify every channel into a single intelligent platform, featuring built-in automation and agent support tools.</p>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> solution helps your team respond quickly and smoothly, with <b>all channels, one dashboard</b>, <b>Ai-powered agent assistance</b>, and <b>live insights and automated replies</b>. We also offer a <b>Ticketing System</b> to keep track of every request, a simple assignment process, and the ability to resolve issues more quickly.</p>\\n\\n<p>Regarding the integration timeline, most of our clients go live in <b>48 hours or less</b>. We handle the heavy lifting so you can focus on your business. Our team will work closely with you to ensure a seamless integration with your existing systems, including CRM and ERP.</p>\\n\\n<p>Here are some key points to consider:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><b>Integration process</b>: We will work with your team to integrate our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> with your existing systems, which typically takes a few hours to a few days, depending on the complexity of the integration.</li>\\n<li><b>Customization</b>: You can teach <b>Lola</b>, our conversational <b>Ai</b>, your products, processes, and brand voice in hours - no coding required. Most clients see full customization in under <b>48 hours</b>.</li>\\n<li><b>Deployment</b>: Our solutions deliver enterprise-grade <b>Ai</b> at SMB-friendly prices, often paying for themselves within <b>3 months</b>.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>If you have any further questions or would like to schedule a demo, please don\'t hesitate to reach out. We\'re here to help you transform your customer support with our <b>Ai Voicebot</b> and <b>Contact Centre</b>.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"a6daf73b-c44d-4c4e-a7ad-6261b8ce618b\", \"sessionId\": \"e00a7a9c-d65b-47c9-9e2e-2a9dfcf05152\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Product exploration\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:57:46','2026-02-14 06:57:57'),(9131,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052356151, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>im swetha i want to know about ai contact centre</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026 at 12:27, &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Swetha, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. I&apos;d be happy to help you with your query &gt; about the integration time of <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b>. Our <b>Advanced Chatbot</b> &gt; solutions are designed to be quickly integrated into your existing systems, &gt; allowing you to start seeing benefits right away. &gt; &gt; The integration time for <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> can vary depending on the &gt; complexity of your specific use case and the systems you&apos;re currently &gt; using. However, our team of experts will work closely with you to ensure a &gt; seamless integration process. &gt; &gt; Some key features of our integration process include: &gt; &gt;    - <b>Fast launch&ndash;rapid learning</b>: Our chatbots can be up and running &gt;    quickly, with rapid learning capabilities to ensure they&apos;re providing &gt;    accurate and helpful responses to your customers. &gt;    - <b>Simple setup process</b>: We&apos;ve designed our integration process to be &gt;    as straightforward as possible, with minimal disruption to your existing &gt;    operations. &gt;    - <b>Scalability</b>: Our solutions are designed to scale with your &gt;    business, so you can be confident that they&apos;ll continue to meet your needs &gt;    as you grow. &gt; &gt; If you&apos;d like to learn more about our integration process or schedule a &gt; demo to see <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> in action, please don&apos;t hesitate to get in &gt; touch with us &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/contact\\\">https://www.worktual.ai/contact</a>&gt;. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual related questions\", \"fromData\": \"Harini <hariniselvan2011@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAMaj++UtH9y9=6kAA6s=nXmSxxEWspMk-=Wz3zW=Afu4gSunpA@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"hariniselvan2011@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052364721, \"message\": \"Dear Swetha,\\n\\nI hope this email finds you well. I\'d be happy to help you with your query about the **Ai Contact Centre**. Our Ai Contact Centre is a unified platform that combines **Ai agents** with human teams to deliver seamless support across every channel, including voice, chat, email, and social media.\\n\\nThe key features of our **Ai Contact Centre** include:\\n<ul>\\n  <li>All channels, one dashboard</li>\\n  <li>**Ai-powered agent assistance**</li>\\n  <li>Designed for scalability</li>\\n  <li>Live insights and Automated replies</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\nOur **Ai Contact Centre** solution helps your team respond quickly and smoothly, providing a better customer experience. With our solution, you can:\\n<p>Utilize real-time dashboards to monitor agent workloads, keep an eye on SLA deadlines, detect delays early, and guarantee every support ticket gets addressed promptly.</p>\\n<p>Gather, organise, and unify customer data from all sources, creating comprehensive profiles that personalise experiences, enhance targeting, and align marketing, sales, and support teams.</p>\\n\\nIf you\'d like to learn more about our **Ai Contact Centre** solution, I\'d be happy to schedule a demo for you. You can also visit our website to <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/\\\">explore our solutions</a> and see how our systems perform in real life.\\n\\nPlease let me know if you have any further questions or if there\'s anything else I can help you with.\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"ef986de8-bca8-4460-9ad6-ad1ef96438b6\", \"sessionId\": \"b5d69554-e6f0-46a9-94fb-94b1d5ec1423\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual related questions\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:59:16','2026-02-14 06:59:25'),(9132,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052361078, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>Hi am haripriya,tell about cdp and cvm</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:28&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Haripriya, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us about the integration timeline for our <b>Ai &gt; Contact Centre</b>. We&apos;re excited to help you unify every channel into a &gt; single intelligent platform, featuring built-in automation and agent &gt; support tools. &gt; &gt; Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> solution helps your team respond quickly and &gt; smoothly, with <b>all channels, one dashboard</b>, <b>Ai-powered agent &gt; assistance</b>, and <b>live insights and automated replies</b>. We also offer a <b>Ticketing &gt; System</b> to keep track of every request, a simple assignment process, and &gt; the ability to resolve issues more quickly. &gt; &gt; Regarding the integration timeline, most of our clients go live in <b>48 &gt; hours or less</b>. We handle the heavy lifting so you can focus on your &gt; business. Our team will work closely with you to ensure a seamless &gt; integration with your existing systems, including CRM and ERP. &gt; &gt; Here are some key points to consider: &gt; &gt;    - <b>Integration process</b>: We will work with your team to integrate our <b>Ai &gt;    Contact Centre</b> with your existing systems, which typically takes a &gt;    few hours to a few days, depending on the complexity of the integration. &gt;    - <b>Customization</b>: You can teach <b>Lola</b>, our conversational <b>Ai</b>, your &gt;    products, processes, and brand voice in hours - no coding required. Most &gt;    clients see full customization in under <b>48 hours</b>. &gt;    - <b>Deployment</b>: Our solutions deliver enterprise-grade <b>Ai</b> at &gt;    SMB-friendly prices, often paying for themselves within <b>3 months</b>. &gt; &gt; If you have any further questions or would like to schedule a demo, please &gt; don&apos;t hesitate to reach out. We&apos;re here to help you transform your customer &gt; support with our <b>Ai Voicebot</b> and <b>Contact Centre</b>. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Product exploration\", \"fromData\": \"mithun nivi <mithunnivi785@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAELB6okA5s=6srUzAxQxd1MTFqdv9WpriFNso+J7DzXv1nEjUw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"mithunnivi785@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052369078, \"message\": \"Dear Haripriya,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to me. I\'d be happy to help you understand more about <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b>.</p>\\n\\n<p>A <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> is a system that gathers, organizes, and unifies customer data from all sources, creating comprehensive profiles that personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align marketing, sales, and support teams. The key features of a CDP include:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>A single platform for all customer data</li>\\n<li>Integration with every channel seamlessly</li>\\n<li>Cleansing and merging data effortlessly</li>\\n<li>Uncomplicated activation</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p><b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> uses real-time insights to track, segment, and grow customer value. It helps boost customer retention and revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer journeys. The key features of CVM include:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Spotting early signs of churn</li>\\n<li>Identifying big spenders</li>\\n<li>Maximizing customer retention</li>\\n<li>Driving growth with data-driven insights</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>I hope this information helps you understand CDP and CVM better. If you have any more questions or need further clarification, please don\'t hesitate to ask.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"2751cd50-5877-417f-99b5-199329c1e5b4\", \"sessionId\": \"886844a2-9825-441c-868f-1ea23f3e0d2e\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Product exploration\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:59:21','2026-02-14 06:59:29'),(9133,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052361253, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>im harish explain about campaign management</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:27&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Harish, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. I&apos;d be happy to help you understand the &gt; difference between <b>Lukas</b> and <b>Lola</b>, our two chatbot solutions. &gt; &gt; <b>Lukas</b> is our <b>Standard Chatbot</b> that manages routine tasks like &gt; appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment processing &gt; across web, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Meta platforms. It&apos;s a <b>Task-oriented &gt; Ai assistant</b> that provides <b>Quick and dependable responses</b> and has a <b>Simple &gt; setup process</b>. <b>Lukas</b> also provides <b>24/7 customer support</b>. &gt; &gt; On the other hand, <b>Lola</b> is our <b>Advanced Chatbot</b> that understands &gt; subtle cues like intent, tone, and complexity, plus drives lead generation. &gt; She enables businesses to manage thousands of chats efficiently, delivering &gt; consistent, <b>24/7 support</b>. <b>Lola</b> is equipped with <b>Cutting-edge &gt; conversational Ai</b>, provides <b>Deeper customer insights</b>, and offers <b>Fully &gt; automated support from start to finish</b> with <b>Fast launch&ndash;rapid learning</b>. &gt; &gt; In summary, while both <b>Lukas</b> and <b>Lola</b> are designed to provide &gt; excellent customer support, <b>Lukas</b> is more focused on routine tasks and &gt; provides quick responses, whereas <b>Lola</b> is a more advanced solution that &gt; can understand complex customer queries and provide personalized support. &gt; &gt; If you&apos;d like to learn more about our chatbot solutions, you can visit our &gt; website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or Lukas &gt; &lt;<a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/lukas/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/lukas/</a>&gt; and Lola &gt; &lt;<a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/lola/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/lola/</a>&gt; specifically. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual testing\", \"fromData\": \"Harish P <harish4buildtech@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAHe1u2HUQyD5ZbZsFOvKPZRevP1tp=_4NfnW3txB+Td3KHVh=A@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"harish4buildtech@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052370401, \"message\": \"Dear Harish,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us about <b>Campaign Management</b>. Our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool allows you to easily create, schedule, and oversee campaigns across multiple channels. With our tool, you can reach your audience precisely using tools designed for consistency, timing, and easily generated campaigns.</p>\\n\\n<p>Some of the key features of our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool include:</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li><b>All channels, one dashboard</b>: Manage all your campaigns from a single dashboard, making it easy to track and analyze your results.</li>\\n  <li><b>Ai-powered agent assistance</b>: Our AI-powered agents can help you automate and optimize your campaigns, saving you time and resources.</li>\\n  <li><b>Designed for scalability</b>: Our tool is designed to scale with your business, so you can easily manage large and complex campaigns.</li>\\n  <li><b>Live insights and Automated replies</b>: Get real-time insights into your campaign performance and automate replies to common customer inquiries.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool is part of our larger suite of <b>AI Contact Centre</b> solutions, which include <b>Ticketing System</b>, <b>Customer Data Platform</b>, and <b>Customer Value Management</b>. These tools work together to help you provide a seamless and personalized customer experience across all channels.</p>\\n\\n<p>If you\'d like to learn more about our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool or schedule a demo, please <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/get-in-touch\\\">click here</a> to get in touch with our team.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"e32fb040-7178-4f08-8dcd-a260999ad0cb\", \"sessionId\": \"f1ee38e1-06a6-4085-be4e-3803867f14d1\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:59:21','2026-02-14 06:59:30'),(9134,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052366112, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>Hey there, I am Christina,</p><br/><p>I want to know about Lola and lukas.</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026, 12:27&#x202F;pm , &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Hello Christina, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us. I&apos;d be happy to help you with your query &gt; about the integration timeline for <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer &gt; Value Management (CVM)</b>. &gt; &gt; The integration timeline may vary depending on the complexity of the &gt; project and the specific requirements of your business. However, I can &gt; provide you with a general outline of the steps involved in integrating &gt; <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b>. &gt; &gt;    - The first step is to consolidate customer data from various sources &gt;    into a single, unified platform. This can be done using our <b>CDP</b>, &gt;    which can integrate with multiple data sources and provide a 360-degree &gt;    view of your customers. &gt;    - Once the data is consolidated, we can start building <b>CVM</b> models to &gt;    analyze customer behavior, predict intent, and identify opportunities to &gt;    increase customer value. &gt;    - The next step is to integrate the <b>CVM</b> models with our <b>Lola</b> &gt;    conversational chatbot, which can provide personalized recommendations and &gt;    support to customers in real-time. &gt;    - Finally, we can deploy the integrated solution and provide ongoing &gt;    support and maintenance to ensure that it continues to meet your business &gt;    needs. &gt; &gt; In terms of timeline, the integration process can typically take anywhere &gt; from a few weeks to several months, depending on the complexity of the &gt; project. However, we can provide you with a more detailed timeline and &gt; project plan once we have a better understanding of your specific &gt; requirements. &gt; &gt; If you&apos;d like to learn more about our <b>CDP</b> and <b>CVM</b> solutions, I&apos;d be &gt; happy to schedule a call to discuss further. You can also visit our website &gt; at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> to learn more about our products and services. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Email bot testing\", \"fromData\": \"Christina Evangeline <christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CABYt-2CLCGYVBc2dOy6AZZf_znNF1FB34iQ8Tq-+kqcP1LEXRg@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052374579, \"message\": \"Dear Christina,\\n\\n<p>I hope this email finds you well. I\'d be happy to provide you with information about <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b>, our advanced chatbot solutions.</p>\\n\\n<p><b>Lola</b> is our advanced conversational Ai chatbot that understands subtle cues like intent, tone, and complexity, plus drives lead generation. She enables businesses to manage thousands of chats efficiently, delivering consistent, 24/7 support. With <b>Lola</b>, you can enjoy cutting-edge conversational Ai, deeper customer insights, fully automated support from start to finish, and fast launch–rapid learning.</p>\\n\\n<p>On the other hand, <b>Lukas</b> is our standard chatbot that manages routine tasks like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment processing across web, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Meta platforms. <b>Lukas</b> is a task-oriented Ai assistant that provides quick and dependable responses, has a simple setup process, and offers 24/7 customer support.</p>\\n\\n<p>Both <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> can be integrated with our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> solution, which unifies every channel into a single intelligent platform, featuring built-in automation and agent support tools. This helps your team respond quickly and smoothly to customer inquiries.</p>\\n\\n<p>If you\'d like to learn more about <b>Lola</b>, <b>Lukas</b>, or our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> solution, please don\'t hesitate to reach out. You can also <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.uk\\\">visit our website</a> or <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.uk/contact\\\">contact us</a> directly to schedule a demo or discuss your specific needs.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"97108181-9f5e-4870-81de-7e38de69f586\", \"sessionId\": \"187a2633-ab5f-44a0-9c83-3ea74358ad3a\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Email bot testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 06:59:26','2026-02-14 06:59:35'),(9135,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052546103, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>how you contact centre is differ from other?</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026 at 12:29, &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Swetha, I hope this email finds you well. I&apos;d be happy to help you &gt; with your query about the <b></b>Ai Contact Centre<b></b>. Our Ai Contact Centre is a &gt; unified platform that combines <b></b>Ai agents<b></b> with human teams to deliver &gt; seamless support across every channel, including voice, chat, email, and &gt; social media. The key features of our <b></b>Ai Contact Centre<b></b> include: &gt; &gt;    - All channels, one dashboard &gt;    - <b></b>Ai-powered agent assistance<b></b> &gt;    - Designed for scalability &gt;    - Live insights and Automated replies &gt; &gt; Our <b></b>Ai Contact Centre<b></b> solution helps your team respond quickly and &gt; smoothly, providing a better customer experience. With our solution, you &gt; can: &gt; &gt; Utilize real-time dashboards to monitor agent workloads, keep an eye on &gt; SLA deadlines, detect delays early, and guarantee every support ticket gets &gt; addressed promptly. &gt; &gt; Gather, organise, and unify customer data from all sources, creating &gt; comprehensive profiles that personalise experiences, enhance targeting, and &gt; align marketing, sales, and support teams. &gt; If you&apos;d like to learn more about our <b></b>Ai Contact Centre<b></b> solution, I&apos;d &gt; be happy to schedule a demo for you. You can also visit our website to explore &gt; our solutions &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/\\\">https://www.worktual.ai/</a>&gt; and see how our systems perform &gt; in real life. Please let me know if you have any further questions or if &gt; there&apos;s anything else I can help you with. Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual related questions\", \"fromData\": \"Harini <hariniselvan2011@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAMaj++VOx-5J2RHk2Eq_HSHCGCKFt0c3Oz378hGPpJW6K_XxvQ@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"hariniselvan2011@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052554308, \"message\": \"Dear Customer,\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> is a unique and innovative solution that sets us apart from other contact centres. It is designed to unify every channel into a single intelligent platform, featuring built-in automation and agent support tools. This allows our team to respond quickly and smoothly to customer inquiries, providing a seamless and efficient experience.</p>\\n\\n<p>Some key features that differentiate our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> from others include:</p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li><b>All channels, one dashboard</b>: Our platform allows you to manage all your customer interactions from a single dashboard, providing a unified view of all channels.</li>\\n<li><b>Ai-powered agent assistance</b>: Our <b>Ai</b> technology provides agents with real-time support and guidance, enabling them to resolve issues more efficiently.</li>\\n<li><b>Designed for scalability</b>: Our platform is designed to scale with your business, handling large volumes of customer interactions with ease.</li>\\n<li><b>Live insights and Automated replies</b>: Our platform provides live insights and automated replies, enabling you to respond quickly to customer inquiries and improve response times.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>In addition to these features, our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> also includes a range of other tools and technologies, such as <b>Ticketing System</b>, <b>Customer Data Platform</b>, and <b>Customer Value Management</b>. These tools work together to provide a comprehensive and integrated solution for managing customer interactions and improving customer experience.</p>\\n\\n<p>For more information on our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> and how it can benefit your business, please visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai\\\">https://www.worktual.ai</a> or contact us directly to schedule a demo.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"4035cfb3-4131-4902-8330-3de56599dac9\", \"sessionId\": \"525bface-eb0c-4c87-9ac1-2f21612b1cf5\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual related questions\"}}}]','2026-02-14 07:02:26','2026-02-14 07:02:34'),(9136,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052546318, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>im harish tell me what are the insights we will get and how you stand apart from other solutions</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:29&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Harish, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to us about <b>Campaign Management</b>. Our <b>Campaign &gt; Management</b> tool allows you to easily create, schedule, and oversee &gt; campaigns across multiple channels. With our tool, you can reach your &gt; audience precisely using tools designed for consistency, timing, and easily &gt; generated campaigns. &gt; &gt; Some of the key features of our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool include: &gt; &gt;    - <b>All channels, one dashboard</b>: Manage all your campaigns from a &gt;    single dashboard, making it easy to track and analyze your results. &gt;    - <b>Ai-powered agent assistance</b>: Our AI-powered agents can help you &gt;    automate and optimize your campaigns, saving you time and resources. &gt;    - <b>Designed for scalability</b>: Our tool is designed to scale with your &gt;    business, so you can easily manage large and complex campaigns. &gt;    - <b>Live insights and Automated replies</b>: Get real-time insights into &gt;    your campaign performance and automate replies to common customer inquiries. &gt; &gt; Our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool is part of our larger suite of <b>AI Contact &gt; Centre</b> solutions, which include <b>Ticketing System</b>, <b>Customer Data &gt; Platform</b>, and <b>Customer Value Management</b>. These tools work together to &gt; help you provide a seamless and personalized customer experience across all &gt; channels. &gt; &gt; If you&apos;d like to learn more about our <b>Campaign Management</b> tool or &gt; schedule a demo, please click here &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai/get-in-touch\\\">https://www.worktual.ai/get-in-touch</a>&gt; &gt; to get in touch with our team. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"worktual testing\", \"fromData\": \"Harish P <harish4buildtech@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAHe1u2EbOy3x9RJ-84JdUXJ1K0OD_J+2H_YbMG4UG7SNjLgz-A@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"harish4buildtech@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052557336, \"message\": \"Dear Harish,\\n\\nThank you for reaching out to us. We\'re excited to share with you the insights you can gain from our **Ai Contact Centre** and how we stand apart from other solutions.\\n\\nOur **Ai Contact Centre** provides real-time insights to track, segment, and grow customer value. With our solution, you can:\\n\\n* <b>Spot early signs of churn</b> and take proactive measures to retain customers\\n* <b>Identify big spenders</b> and tailor your marketing efforts to target high-value customers\\n* <b>Maximise customer retention</b> by delivering personalized experiences and support\\n* <b>Drive growth with data-driven insights</b> and make informed decisions to optimize your business\\n\\nWhat sets us apart from other solutions is our ability to unify every channel into a single intelligent platform, featuring built-in automation and agent support tools. Our **Ai-powered agent assistance** enables your team to respond quickly and smoothly, while our **Live insights and Automated replies** ensure that every customer interaction is timely and effective.\\n\\nAdditionally, our **Lola - Advanced Chatbot** and **Lukas - Standard Chatbot** provide cutting-edge conversational Ai capabilities, allowing you to manage thousands of chats efficiently and deliver consistent, 24/7 support.\\n\\nTo learn more about our solutions and how they can benefit your business, you can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or schedule a demo with our team.\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"e6482230-52f5-42dc-a102-2846ea3dbb1f\", \"sessionId\": \"52916f7b-303d-4ecd-90da-19825a6b646a\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"worktual testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 07:02:26','2026-02-14 07:02:37'),(9137,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052546318, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>can u tell how this product is different from others?</p><br/><p>On Sat, Feb 14, 2026 at 12:29&#x202F;PM &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Haripriya, &gt; &gt; Thank you for reaching out to me. I&apos;d be happy to help you understand more &gt; about <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> and <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> &gt; . &gt; &gt; A <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b> is a system that gathers, organizes, and &gt; unifies customer data from all sources, creating comprehensive profiles &gt; that personalize experiences, enhance targeting, and align marketing, &gt; sales, and support teams. The key features of a CDP include: &gt; &gt;    - A single platform for all customer data &gt;    - Integration with every channel seamlessly &gt;    - Cleansing and merging data effortlessly &gt;    - Uncomplicated activation &gt; &gt; <b>Customer Value Management (CVM)</b> uses real-time insights to track, &gt; segment, and grow customer value. It helps boost customer retention and &gt; revenue with smarter customer segmentation and personalized customer &gt; journeys. The key features of CVM include: &gt; &gt;    - Spotting early signs of churn &gt;    - Identifying big spenders &gt;    - Maximizing customer retention &gt;    - Driving growth with data-driven insights &gt; &gt; I hope this information helps you understand CDP and CVM better. If you &gt; have any more questions or need further clarification, please don&apos;t &gt; hesitate to ask. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Product exploration\", \"fromData\": \"mithun nivi <mithunnivi785@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CAELB6ok95QPu=GYVFJpsKV4ACRxNm7MScXKCs3pJwC7nSMteMg@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"mithunnivi785@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052555898, \"message\": \"Dear Customer,\\n\\n<p>Our <b>Lola</b> conversational chatbot is different from others in several ways. Firstly, it is integrated with our <b>Customer Data Platform (CDP)</b>, which allows it to access and utilize customer data from various sources, providing a unified and personalized experience. This integration enables <b>Lola</b> to deliver <b>personalized interactions</b>, <b>contextual responses</b>, and <b>proactive recommendations</b> based on customer behavior and preferences.</p>\\n\\n<p>Additionally, <b>Lola</b> is designed to handle complex inquiries and escalate them to live agents with full context, ensuring seamless support. Our chatbot also provides <b>real-time analytics</b> and <b>actionable insights</b> to help businesses optimize their marketing campaigns and improve customer engagement.</p>\\n\\n<p>What sets us apart from others is our focus on <b>advanced intelligence</b> and <b>bespoke solutions</b> that cater to specific business needs. We offer a range of products, including <b>Ai Contact Centre</b>, <b>Customer Data Platform</b>, <b>Customer Value Management</b>, and <b>Campaign Management</b>, all designed to help businesses build stronger relationships with their customers.</p>\\n\\n<p>If you\'d like to learn more about our products and solutions, you can visit our website at <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/</a> or <a href=\\\"https://worktual.co.uk/product/lola/\\\">https://worktual.co.uk/product/lola/</a> to explore <b>Lola</b> in more detail.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"6917b5aa-8c58-4b2a-975f-78b7012f8a93\", \"sessionId\": \"92be84a3-baab-4a7e-a189-bc3c28eb3263\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Product exploration\"}}}]','2026-02-14 07:02:26','2026-02-14 07:02:36'),(9138,'[{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771052551053, \"toData\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"message\": \"<p>Hi, I want to know how does Lola and lukas stands apart from others.</p><br/><p>On Sat, 14 Feb 2026, 12:29&#x202F;pm , &lt;<a href=\\\"mailto:support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\\\">support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech</a>&gt; wrote:</p><br/><p>&gt; Dear Christina, &gt; &gt; I hope this email finds you well. I&apos;d be happy to provide you with &gt; information about <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b>, our advanced chatbot solutions. &gt; &gt; <b>Lola</b> is our advanced conversational Ai chatbot that understands subtle &gt; cues like intent, tone, and complexity, plus drives lead generation. She &gt; enables businesses to manage thousands of chats efficiently, delivering &gt; consistent, 24/7 support. With <b>Lola</b>, you can enjoy cutting-edge &gt; conversational Ai, deeper customer insights, fully automated support from &gt; start to finish, and fast launch&ndash;rapid learning. &gt; &gt; On the other hand, <b>Lukas</b> is our standard chatbot that manages routine &gt; tasks like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment &gt; processing across web, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Meta platforms. <b>Lukas</b> &gt; is a task-oriented Ai assistant that provides quick and dependable &gt; responses, has a simple setup process, and offers 24/7 customer support. &gt; &gt; Both <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> can be integrated with our <b>Ai Contact Centre</b> &gt; solution, which unifies every channel into a single intelligent platform, &gt; featuring built-in automation and agent support tools. This helps your team &gt; respond quickly and smoothly to customer inquiries. &gt; &gt; If you&apos;d like to learn more about <b>Lola</b>, <b>Lukas</b>, or our <b>Ai Contact &gt; Centre</b> solution, please don&apos;t hesitate to reach out. You can also visit &gt; our website &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.uk\\\">https://www.worktual.uk</a>&gt; or contact us &gt; &lt;<a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.uk/contact\\\">https://www.worktual.uk/contact</a>&gt; directly to schedule a demo or discuss &gt; your specific needs. &gt; Thanks and regards, AI ASSISTANT</p>\", \"subject\": \"Email bot testing\", \"fromData\": \"Christina Evangeline <christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com>\", \"messageId\": \"<CABYt-2AN-iQ_XtezifdzHH6Fm1XtVaC1iL2v4rPN2uBJYuU1hw@mail.gmail.com>\", \"attachments\": []}}}, {\"agentText\": {\"message\": {\"cc\": \"\", \"to\": \"christinaevangeline0608@gmail.com\", \"bcc\": \"\", \"from\": \"support@wstestyetoto7848.worktual.tech\", \"isBot\": true, \"isLike\": 0, \"pdfurl\": \"\", \"sendAt\": 1771052558900, \"message\": \"Dear Customer,\\n\\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. We\'re excited to introduce you to our cutting-edge chatbot solutions, <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b>, which stand apart from others in the market.</p>\\n\\n<p><b>Lola</b>, our advanced chatbot, understands subtle cues like intent, tone, and complexity, driving lead generation and enabling businesses to manage thousands of chats efficiently. She delivers consistent, 24/7 support with features like:</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li>Cutting-edge conversational Ai</li>\\n  <li>Deeper customer insights</li>\\n  <li>Fully automated support from start to finish</li>\\n  <li>Fast launch–rapid learning</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>On the other hand, <b>Lukas</b>, our standard chatbot, manages routine tasks like appointment bookings, scheduling, form submissions, and payment processing across web, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Meta platforms. He provides:</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li>Task-oriented Ai assistant</li>\\n  <li>Quick and dependable responses</li>\\n  <li>Simple setup process</li>\\n  <li>24/7 customer support</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>Both <b>Lola</b> and <b>Lukas</b> are designed to provide exceptional customer support and can be tailored to meet the specific needs of your business. If you\'d like to learn more about how our chatbot solutions can benefit your organization, please visit our website by clicking <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai\\\">here</a> or <a href=\\\"https://www.worktual.ai\\\">book a demo</a> to see our systems in action.</p>\\n\\nThanks and regards,\\nAI ASSISTANT\", \"fileType\": \"\", \"direction\": \"OUT\", \"messageID\": \"95ef0e8f-c5a5-4b7c-8e68-94242cb2acab\", \"sessionId\": \"54cca6e3-ead6-450b-a190-84cca29182c5\", \"isCustomer\": false, \"attachments\": [], \"messageType\": \"text\", \"EmailSubject\": \"Email bot testing\"}}}]','2026-02-14 07:02:31','2026-02-14 07:02:39'),(9139,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771331710971, \"toData\": \"financeteam@worktual.co.uk\", \"message\": \"this is testing email\", \"subject\": \"this is testing email\", \"fromData\": \"k.sekar@worktual.com\", \"messageId\": \"<MA0P287MB2024C0E5AE0E99A92575A703936DA@MA0P287MB2024.INDP287.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-02-17 12:35:11','2026-02-17 12:35:11'),(9140,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771335196765, \"toData\": \"financeteam@worktual.co.uk\", \"message\": \"fwfwfwf\", \"subject\": \"dwwfw\", \"fromData\": \"k.sekar@worktual.com\", \"messageId\": \"<MA0P287MB20241560B5B1383BE128B138936DA@MA0P287MB2024.INDP287.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-02-17 13:33:17','2026-02-17 13:33:17'),(9141,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771335196767, \"toData\": \"financeteam@worktual.co.uk\", \"message\": \"testinggg\", \"subject\": \"testinggg\", \"fromData\": \"k.sekar@worktual.com\", \"messageId\": \"<MA0P287MB20246AD60A34705068E8598C936DA@MA0P287MB2024.INDP287.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>\", \"attachments\": []}}}','2026-02-17 13:33:17','2026-02-17 13:33:17'),(9142,'{\"userText\": {\"message\": {\"sendAt\": 1771335201428, \"toDat