essionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771835182611}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"918667245633 and 918148805657\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771835212257}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got it! Added the following contacts to your campaign:</p><ul><li>918667245633</li><li>918148805657</li></ul><p>Would you like to add another contact? If yes, please provide the phone number with country code. If you are done, just reply with <strong>no</strong>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771835212253}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"done\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771835223058}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>What is the maximum call handling time (duration) for each call, in minutes? Please provide a number (e.g., 10).</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771835223056}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"5\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771835233650}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hii\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771836339321}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Hello! 👋 I\'m here to help you with your outbound call campaigns.</p><p>Would you like to <strong>create a new campaign</strong> or <strong>update an existing one</strong> (enable/disable, pause/resume, or force stop)? Please let me know what you\'d like to do.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771836339319}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"create one\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838160614}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! Let\'s get started with creating your new outbound campaign.</p><p>First, please provide a name for the campaign. <strong>Note:</strong> The name should contain only letters (no numbers) and must be unique.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838160612}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test campaign\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838202909}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Thanks for the name <strong>New Test campaign</strong>.</p><p>Could you provide a short description for the campaign? This is optional – you can type \'skip\' if you’d like to omit it.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838202908}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"skip\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838207816}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got it – no description will be added.</p><p>Now, please select the trigger type for the campaign:</p><ul><li><strong>Immediate</strong> – the campaign will start right away.</li><li><strong>Daily</strong> – the campaign will run on selected days between specified times.</li><li><strong>Only once</strong> – the campaign will run a single time on a specific date and time.</li></ul><p>Enter <em>immediate</em>, <em>daily</em>, or <em>only once</em> to continue.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838207813}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"immediate\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838217270}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Thanks! Since you chose <strong>Immediate</strong> trigger, we just need a few more details to set up your campaign.</p><p>Please select an outbound number for the campaign from the following options:</p><ul><li>441420366562</li><li>918925412481</li><li>918870004696</li><li>918870004534</li><li>917200460263</li><li>917200462569</li><li>917200461926</li><li>917200460689</li><li>917200460568</li><li>919515812418</li><li>441412560194</li></ul><p>Enter the number you would like to use.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838217267}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"917200460689\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838230456}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Thanks for selecting the outbound number <strong>917200460689</strong>.</p><p>Now, please let me know how you would like to add contacts for this campaign:</p><ul><li><strong>CSV</strong> – you can upload a CSV file (format: <a href=\\\\\\\"https://nlp-storage.worktual.co.uk/wsnlp/outbound_campaign/Sample.csv\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">download sample CSV</a>).</li><li><strong>One by one</strong> – you can provide phone numbers one at a time.</li></ul><p>Enter <em>csv</em> or <em>one by one</em> to continue.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838230454}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"one by one\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838305599}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Please provide the first contact\'s phone number with the country code (e.g., <code>919876543210</code> for India). When you have added all contacts, type <strong>done</strong>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838305597}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"918667245633 and 918148805657\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838325137}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got the contacts <strong>918667245633</strong> and <strong>918148805657</strong>.</p><p>If you have more contacts to add, please provide their phone numbers (you can list them separated by commas or spaces). When you are finished adding contacts, just type <strong>done</strong>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838325135}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"done\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838335195}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! We have the contacts ready.</p><p>Please specify the <strong>maximum call handling time</strong> for each call, in minutes (e.g., <code>5</code> or <code>10</code>).</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838335192}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"6\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838862670}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Thanks for specifying the maximum call handling time of <strong>6 minutes</strong>.</p><p>Finally, could you provide a <strong>title</strong> for this campaign? This can be a short phrase that helps you identify the campaign later (e.g., \\\\\\\"New Test Campaign\\\\\\\").</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838862667}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"new campaign\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838887470}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>I\'m sorry, I couldn\'t create the campaign at this moment. Please try again later.</p><p>If you’d like to start over or need any further assistance, just let me know.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771838887468}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hii\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839064029}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Hi there! 👋 I’m here to help you set up or manage your outbound call campaigns.</div><div>Would you like to <strong>create a new campaign</strong> or <strong>update an existing one</strong> (e.g., enable, disable, pause, or stop)? Please let me know what you’d like to do.</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839064029}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"create a new\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839100333}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Great! Let’s get started with creating your new outbound campaign.</div>\\\\n<div>Please provide a <strong>campaign name</strong>. It should not contain any numbers and must be unique (no other active campaign should have the same name).</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839100330}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test campaign\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839187217}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Thanks for the campaign name: <strong>New Test campaign</strong>.</div>\\\\n<div>Please provide a short <strong>description</strong> for the campaign (optional). If you don\'t want to add one, just type \\\\\\\"skip\\\\\\\".</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839187214}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"skip\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839192670}\", \"{