 <a href=\\\\\\\"https://nlp-storage.worktual.co.uk/wsnlp/outbound_campaign/Sample.csv\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">here</a>).</li>\\\\n<li><strong>one_by_one</strong> – add contacts one at a time by providing phone numbers with country code.</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n<div>Reply with <code>csv</code> or <code>one_by_one</code> to continue.</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839212769}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"one by one\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839223832}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Please provide the first contact\'s phone number with country code (e.g., <code>918123456789</code> for an Indian number).<br>When you have added all contacts, simply reply with <code>done</code>.</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839223830}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"918667245633 and 918148805657\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839285532}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Thanks! I’ve added the contacts you provided:</div>\\\\n<ul><li>918667245633</li><li>918148805657</li></ul>\\\\n<div>If you have more contacts to add, please provide the next phone number (with country code). When you are finished adding contacts, simply reply with <code>done</code>.</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839285529}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"done\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839299116}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Great! We have the contacts and outbound number set.</div>\\\\n<div>Please provide a short <strong>title</strong> for this campaign (this will be used as the draft title).</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839299114}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"skip\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839309787}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>The campaign title is required to create the campaign.</div>\\\\n<div>Would you like to use the campaign name <strong>New Test campaign</strong> as the title? If you prefer a different title, please type it now.</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839309784}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"yes use it\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839325110}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<div>Almost done! Please provide the <strong>maximum call handling time</strong> for each call in minutes (e.g., <code>5</code> minutes).</div>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839325108}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"6\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839333771}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hii\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839490182}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Hello! How can I assist you today? Would you like to set up a new outbound campaign or manage an existing one?</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839490180}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"create new campaign\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839505008}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Sure, let’s set up a new outbound campaign. First, what would you like to name the campaign? Please use only letters and spaces, no numbers.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839505006}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test campaign\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839517307}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! Do you have a short description for \\\\\\\"New Test campaign\\\\\\\"? You can skip this if you prefer.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839517305}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"skip\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839525867}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>What trigger type would you like for the campaign? You can choose <strong>Immediate</strong> (run now), <strong>Daily</strong> (recurring), or <strong>Only Once</strong> (single scheduled run).</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839525865}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"immediate\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839533929}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got it – we’ll set the campaign to run <strong>immediately</strong>. Please select an outbound number from the following list:<ul><li>441420366562</li><li>918925412481</li><li>918870004696</li><li>918870004534</li><li>917200460263</li><li>917200462569</li><li>917200461926</li><li>917200460689</li><li>917200460568</li><li>919515812418</li><li>441412560194</li></ul>Reply with the number you’d like to use.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839533927}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"917200460689\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839546827}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! Now, how would you like to provide the contacts for the campaign? You can either <strong>add contacts one by one</strong> or <strong>upload a CSV file</strong>. If you choose CSV, you can download a sample CSV <a href=\\\\\\\"https://nlp-storage.worktual.co.uk/wsnlp/outbound_campaign/Sample.csv\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">here</a>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839546825}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"one by one\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839563829}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Please provide the phone number (including country code) for the first contact. For example, <code>+918765432178</code> or <code>918765432178</code>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839563826}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"918667245633 and 918148805657\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839624948}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got it! I’ve added the following contacts:\\\\n<ul><li>918667245633</li><li>918148805657</li></ul>\\\\nWould you like to add another contact? Please reply with the phone number (including country code) or say “no” to finish adding contacts.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839624946}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"no\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4ed4-b4cd-f3aad725328a\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771839642016}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Finally, please specify the maximum call handling time (duration) for each call in minutes. This should be a positive number (e.g., 5, 10, 15).</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"87946555-37bf-4e