"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test campaign\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912186705}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>The campaign name \\\\\\\"New Test campaign\\\\\\\" is already in use. Please provide a different, unique name without numbers.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912186703}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test campaign two\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912210240}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>The name \\\\\\\"New Test campaign two\\\\\\\" is already taken (it matches an existing campaign). Please provide a different, unique name for your new campaign, without any numbers.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912210239}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test campaign three\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912223472}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! \\\\\\\"New Test campaign three\\\\\\\" is available.</p><p>Please provide a short description for this outbound campaign (you can skip this if you prefer).</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912223471}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"New Test Campaign Three is an outbound outreach initiative designed to engage targeted prospects, introduce our offerings, and generate qualified leads through structured communication and follow-up.”\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912285744}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Thank you for the description.</p><p>What trigger type would you like for the campaign? Please choose one of the following options:</p><ul><li><strong>Immediate</strong> – the campaign will start right away.</li><li><strong>Daily</strong> – the campaign will run on selected days with a schedule.</li><li><strong>Only Once</strong> – the campaign will run a single time on a specific date and time.</li></ul><p>Please type <em>Immediate</em>, <em>Daily</em>, or <em>Only Once</em>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912285742}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"daily\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912301664}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! For the daily trigger, please provide the <strong>start date</strong> for the campaign. It should be today (2026-02-24) or a future date, in the format <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912301662}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"feb 23\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912346430}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>The date you provided (<strong>Feb 23</strong>) is in the past (today is 2026-02-24). Please provide a start date that is today or a future date, such as <code>2026-02-25</code> or later.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912346429}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"tomorrow\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912360782}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got it! The start date will be set to <strong>2026-02-25</strong>.</p><p>Do you have an <strong>end date</strong> for this daily campaign? Please provide it in <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code> format, or type <em>skip</em> if you don’t want to set an end date.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174