s with the number of recall attempts (1‑8) per day, e.g., <code>Answered:2, UnAnswered:1</code>. If you don\'t need any frequency settings, just type <em>skip</em>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912472299}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"skip\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912518668}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Please select an outbound number for this campaign from the following options:</p><ul><li>441420366562</li><li>918925412481</li><li>918870004696</li><li>918870004534</li><li>917200460263</li><li>917200462569</li><li>917200461926</li><li>917200460689</li><li>917200460568</li><li>919515812418</li><li>441412560194</li></ul><p>Reply with the number you would like to use.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912518667}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"2nd one\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912549564}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>How would you like to provide the contacts for this campaign?</p><ul><li><strong>CSV</strong> – you can upload a CSV file (the format should include a <code>PhoneNumber</code> column). You can download a sample CSV <a href=\\\\\\\"https://nlp-storage.worktual.co.uk/wsnlp/outbound_campaign/Sample.csv\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">here</a>.</li><li><strong>One by one</strong> – you can provide each phone number individually.</li></ul><p>Please type <em>CSV</em> or <em>One by one</em>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912549562}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"csv\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771912594459}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! To 