\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914732769}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Got it! Your daily campaign will run from <strong>2026-02-24</strong> to <strong>2026-03-10</strong> on <strong>Monday</strong> and <strong>Wednesday</strong> with the following time window for each day:</p>\\\\n<ul>\\\\n  <li>Start Time: <strong>09:00 AM</strong></li>\\\\n  <li>End Time: <strong>05:00 PM</strong></li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n<p>If you’d like to set a recall <strong>frequency</strong>, please specify the call status and the number of recalls per day (1‑8). You can provide multiple statuses if needed. For example: <code>Answered:2, Busy:1</code>. If you don’t need any recall frequency, simply reply <code>skip</code>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914732768}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"skip\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914772514}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Now that we have the schedule set, please choose the outbound number you would like to use for this campaign. Here are the available numbers:</p><ul><li>441420366562</li><li>918925412481</li><li>918870004696</li><li>918870004534</li><li>917200460263</li><li>917200462569</li><li>917200461926</li><li>917200460689</li><li>917200460568</li><li>919515812418</li><li>441412560194</li></ul><p>Reply with the number you wish to select.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914772512}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"917200461926\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914801298}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>Great! You have selected the outbound number <strong>917200461926</strong> for the campaign.</p>\\\\n<p>Now we need to add the contacts you want to call. You can provide them in one of two ways:</p>\\\\n<ul>\\\\n  <