all the campaign details except one final piece of information.</p>\\\\n<p>Please specify the <strong>maximum call handling time</strong> for each call in <code>minutes</code>. For example, you could enter <code>5</code> or <code>10</code>.</p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914875521}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"5\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"uploadUrl\\\":null,\\\"isBot\\\":0,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914936531}\", \"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"<p>✅ Your daily outbound campaign has been created successfully!</p>\\\\n<ul>\\\\n  <li><strong>Campaign Name:</strong> new campaign</li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Description:</strong> (none)</li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Trigger:</strong> Daily from <strong>2026-02-24</strong> to <strong>2026-03-10</strong></li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Days Active:</strong> Monday, Wednesday</li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Time Window (each day):</strong> 09:00 AM – 05:00 PM</li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Outbound Number:</strong> 917200461926</li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Contacts:</strong> 916383424853</li>\\\\n  <li><strong>Maximum Call Handling Time:</strong> 5 minutes per call</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n<p>The campaign is now scheduled and will start automatically on the next Monday (2026-02-25) at 09:00 AM.</p>\\\\n<p>Is there anything else I can help you with? You can:\\\\n<ul>\\\\n  <li>Update or pause this campaign</li>\\\\n  <li>Create another campaign</li>\\\\n  <li>Ask any other question</li>\\\\n</ul></p>\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ec28f3fd-8062-4fd5-b511-3174ff433ca9\\\",\\\"isBot\\\":1,\\\"messageId\\\":1771914936529}\"]','2026-02-24 05:49:15','2026-02-24 06:35:56');
